  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pawame Kakuma and Turkana County Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pawame is a social enterprise active in Kenya, distributing and financing solar home systems to off-grid populations. Its mission is to provide access to energy.Pawame makes the promise of clean electrification accessible, by financing these kits and collecting low daily payments by mobile money.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pawame plans to sell 15.992 systems within four years.</narrative>
  </description>
